WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:05.760
In 1634, Amsterdam was captivated by a flower.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.140
Rich and poor gambled on the tulip market.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.480
Sofia was a beautiful orphan

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.160
chosen by one of the richest men in the city.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.800
Love, honour and obey.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.320
I've decided to engage the services of a painter.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.100
Don't move.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.740
Put your brush to capturing my wife.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.620
She's a rare beauty.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.220
They'll say:

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.900
Look at that lucky old dog didn't hear of a

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.440
lovely young wife.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.240
First to flower, first to fall.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.140
Tulip business, I think it's the answer to my problems.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.580
If I were rich I could take you away.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:56.900
He would find us...

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.920
He will not stop looking for me unless I was dead.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:04.600
My lord, I pray that my wife shall be not of corruptible seed.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:06.160
You've been busy?

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:10.280
You're not in painting, no offense.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.400
I made a plan to save us both.

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:14.940
We will be together.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.260
It's nothing without risk.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:19.280
I love you...

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.600
I'll tell your husband what you've been up to.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.380
What have I done?

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:28.140
I bought Sofia.

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:29.080
I must find her!

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.620
Sofia!!!

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:48.140
You two really think you'll carry this off?

